     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A represents the digit 10.</p>\n<p>B represents the digit 11.</p>\n<p>C represents the digit 12.</p>\n<p>D represents the digit 13.</p>\n<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>In base 10: B + 5 = 11 + 5 = 16 = 14 + 2</p>\n<p>In base 14: 12</p>\n<p>One’s place: 2</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 3 + 4 = 8</p>\n<p>In base 14: 8</p>\n<p>This column: 8</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{82_{14}}\"></span></p>"
